      "title": "Latency",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Instrumented in the latency step. Measured from the instant a trade is created to the instant it reaches a sink, which is why the generator stamps records with the wall clock.\n\nExactly-once delivery puts a floor under it: a record is not readable until the checkpoint that produced it commits."
